ShadowMountPlus
---------------

Wings can ask ShadowMountPlus (drakmor/ShadowMountPlus, GPL-3.0) to scan for
new games after a download, through its local HTTP API on 127.0.0.1 (scan and
game list only). ShadowMountPlus is not part of this project and is not
bundled, copied or redistributed here.

Pegasus DL
----------

Wings talks to Pegasus DL over its local HTTP API. Pegasus DL is not part of
this project, is not copied, bundled, mirrored or redistributed here, and is
not covered by this license. Wings bundles no catalogues, sources or download
links.

Only when you ask (Settings > Pegasus DL > Get Pegasus DL, then confirm), Wings
downloads the author's own official release file (Pegasus-dl.elf) straight from
the author's release page on github.com (github.com/pegasus-ps5/pegasus-dl),
checks it against the SHA-256 that GitHub publishes for it, and saves it under
/data/wings/pegasus/. When Pegasus DL is not running and you choose it on the
"Waiting for Pegasus DL" screen (Load once, or Auto-Load, which you can turn off
in Settings > Pegasus DL), Wings re-checks that file against the SHA-256 and sends
it to the payload loader on this console (127.0.0.1 port 9021). It never does
this while Pegasus DL answers, and never writes into a payload manager's folder.
That repository states no licence; the download is your own request to the
author's server, not a redistribution by this project.

